flowchart TD
    Client[Client describes the outcome] --> Consult[Listen and clarify\nGoals, constraints and existing systems]
    Constitution[Product constitution\nTrust through evidence] --> Consult
    Consult --> Project[Private project memory\nRequirements, decisions and history]
    Consult --> Plan[Architect plans the actual system]
    Sources[Maintained public projects\nand primary documentation] --> Review[Review practices and provenance\nVersions, applicability and limits]
    Review --> Knowledge[AtMem engineering knowledge\nCurated patterns and evidence]
    Knowledge --> Retrieve[Retrieve relevant proven practices]
    Retrieve --> Plan
    Project --> Plan
    Skills[Architecture, cloud, security,\nDevOps and FinOps skills] --> Plan
    Plan --> Build[Compose a tailored implementation\nResources, code and connections]
    Build --> Verify[Independent verification\nSchemas, lint, policies, mocks and runtime tests]
    Verify -->|Findings| Repair[Repair generator or implementation\nPreserve requirements and controls]
    Repair --> Build
    Verify -->|Checks pass for the declared scope| Package[Consistent delivery package\nTerraform, application artifacts, Spec Kit and evidence]
    Package --> ClientReview[Client and engineer review\nSupply destination inputs and approve next steps]
    ClientReview --> Operations[Separately authorized account plan,\nstaging deployment and operational validation]
    Verify --> Lessons[Reviewed lessons\nRetain evidence and applicability limits]
    Lessons --> Review
